NAME: a unary while, rotated
DESCRIPTION: the default policy (speed, size) rotates a while with a unary condition: one JMP into the test, which loops back in one instruction; see behtests/while_jn_rotated.beh
SRC:
(let (x 3)
  (seq
    (while (JN x) (SUB 1 x))
    (DAT 0 (store x))))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $_WHC4 , #0     
_WHI4 
  SUB.AB #1     , $_LET1 
_WHC4 
  JMN.B  $_WHI4 , $_LET1 
_WHF4 
_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #3     
  DAT    $0     , $0     